{"file": "Keskustelu-kuntosali.mp3", "duration": 166.33, "segments": [{"start": 0.05, "end": 12.56, "text": "Keskustelu. Haluat liittyä kuntosalin jäseneksi. Soitat kuntosalin asiakaspalveluun. Kuulet asiakaspalvelijan puheenvuorot. Vastaa jokaisen puheenvuoron jälkeen, kun kuulet äänimerkin.", "words": [{"w": "Keskustelu.", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.7}, {"w": "Haluat", "s": 0.7, "e": 1.4}, {"w": "liittyä", "s": 1.4, "e": 2.09}, {"w": "kuntosalin", "s": 2.09, "e": 2.79}, {"w": "jäseneksi.", "s": 2.79, "e": 3.49}, {"w": "Soitat", "s": 3.49, "e": 4.19}, {"w": "kuntosalin", "s": 4.19, "e": 4.89}, {"w": "asiakaspalveluun.", "s": 4.89, "e": 5.58}, {"w": "Kuulet", "s": 5.58, "e": 6.28}, {"w": "asiakaspalvelijan", "s": 6.28, "e": 6.98}, {"w": "puheenvuorot.", "s": 6.98, "e": 7.68}, {"w": "Vastaa", "s": 7.68, "e": 8.38}, {"w": "jokaisen", "s": 8.38, "e": 9.07}, {"w": "puheenvuoron", "s": 9.07, "e": 9.77}, {"w": "jälkeen,", "s": 9.77, "e": 10.47}, {"w": "kun", "s": 10.47, "e": 11.17}, {"w": "kuulet", "s": 11.17, "e": 11.87}, {"w": "äänimerkin.", "s": 11.87, "e": 12.56}]}, {"start": 13.41, "end": 19.03, "text": "Hyvää päivää, Kuntokeskus Voima, Mikko puhelimessa. Miten voin auttaa?", "words": [{"w": "Hyvää", "s": 13.36, "e": 13.99}, {"w": "päivää,", "s": 13.99, "e": 14.62}, {"w": "Kuntokeskus", "s": 14.62, "e": 15.25}, {"w": "Voima,", "s": 15.25, "e": 15.88}, {"w": "Mikko", "s": 15.88, "e": 16.51}, {"w": "puhelimessa.", "s": 16.51, "e": 17.14}, {"w": "Miten", "s": 17.14, "e": 17.77}, {"w": "voin", "s": 17.77, "e": 18.4}, {"w": "auttaa?", "s": 18.4, "e": 19.03}]}, {"start": 39.98, "end": 48.28, "text": "Selvä juttu. Meillä on kaksi vaihtoehtoa: kuukausijäsenyys ja vuosijäsenyys. Kumpi kiinnostaa sinua enemmän?", "words": [{"w": "Selvä", "s": 39.93, "e": 40.57}, {"w": "juttu.", "s": 40.57, "e": 41.21}, {"w": "Meillä", "s": 41.21, "e": 41.85}, {"w": "on", "s": 41.85, "e": 42.5}, {"w": "kaksi", "s": 42.5, "e": 43.14}, {"w": "vaihtoehtoa:", "s": 43.14, "e": 43.78}, {"w": "kuukausijäsenyys", "s": 43.78, "e": 44.42}, {"w": "ja", "s": 44.42, "e": 45.07}, {"w": "vuosijäsenyys.", "s": 45.07, "e": 45.71}, {"w": "Kumpi", "s": 45.71, "e": 46.35}, {"w": "kiinnostaa", "s": 46.35, "e": 46.99}, {"w": "sinua", "s": 46.99, "e": 47.64}, {"w": "enemmän?", "s": 47.64, "e": 48.28}]}, {"start": 69.23, "end": 75.94, "text": "Hyvä valinta. Oletko käynyt kuntosalilla aiemmin, vai tarvitsetko ohjausta laitteiden käytössä?", "words": [{"w": "Hyvä", "s": 69.18, "e": 69.79}, {"w": "valinta.", "s": 69.79, "e": 70.41}, {"w": "Oletko", "s": 70.41, "e": 71.02}, {"w": "käynyt", "s": 71.02, "e": 71.64}, {"w": "kuntosalilla", "s": 71.64, "e": 72.25}, {"w": "aiemmin,", "s": 72.25, "e": 72.87}, {"w": "vai", "s": 72.87, "e": 73.48}, {"w": "tarvitsetko", "s": 73.48, "e": 74.1}, {"w": "ohjausta", "s": 74.1, "e": 74.71}, {"w": "laitteiden", "s": 74.71, "e": 75.33}, {"w": "käytössä?", "s": 75.33, "e": 75.94}]}, {"start": 96.89, "end": 103.67, "text": "Meillä on myös ryhmäliikuntatunteja, esimerkiksi joogaa ja zumbaa. Haluatko kuulla niistä lisää?", "words": [{"w": "Meillä", "s": 96.84, "e": 97.41}, {"w": "on", "s": 97.41, "e": 97.98}, {"w": "myös", "s": 97.98, "e": 98.55}, {"w": "ryhmäliikuntatunteja,", "s": 98.55, "e": 99.12}, {"w": "esimerkiksi", "s": 99.12, "e": 99.69}, {"w": "joogaa", "s": 99.69, "e": 100.26}, {"w": "ja", "s": 100.26, "e": 100.83}, {"w": "zumbaa.", "s": 100.83, "e": 101.4}, {"w": "Haluatko", "s": 101.4, "e": 101.97}, {"w": "kuulla", "s": 101.97, "e": 102.54}, {"w": "niistä", "s": 102.54, "e": 103.11}, {"w": "lisää?", "s": 103.11, "e": 103.67}]}, {"start": 124.62, "end": 131.51, "text": "Tunteja on joka päivä, ja ne kuuluvat jäsenyyden hintaan. Milloin haluaisit tulla tekemään sopimuksen?", "words": [{"w": "Tunteja", "s": 124.57, "e": 125.07}, {"w": "on", "s": 125.07, "e": 125.57}, {"w": "joka", "s": 125.57, "e": 126.06}, {"w": "päivä,", "s": 126.06, "e": 126.56}, {"w": "ja", "s": 126.56, "e": 127.05}, {"w": "ne", "s": 127.05, "e": 127.55}, {"w": "kuuluvat", "s": 127.55, "e": 128.04}, {"w": "jäsenyyden", "s": 128.04, "e": 128.54}, {"w": "hintaan.", "s": 128.54, "e": 129.03}, {"w": "Milloin", "s": 129.03, "e": 129.53}, {"w": "haluaisit", "s": 129.53, "e": 130.02}, {"w": "tulla", "s": 130.02, "e": 130.52}, {"w": "tekemään", "s": 130.52, "e": 131.01}, {"w": "sopimuksen?", "s": 131.01, "e": 131.51}]}, {"start": 147.46, "end": 153.04, "text": "Sopii hyvin. Tervetuloa! Muistathan ottaa henkilöllisyystodistuksen mukaan.", "words": [{"w": "Sopii", "s": 147.41, "e": 148.21}, {"w": "hyvin.", "s": 148.21, "e": 149.02}, {"w": "Tervetuloa!", "s": 149.02, "e": 149.82}, {"w": "Muistathan", "s": 149.82, "e": 150.62}, {"w": "ottaa", "s": 150.62, "e": 151.43}, {"w": "henkilöllisyystodistuksen", "s": 151.43, "e": 152.23}, {"w": "mukaan.", "s": 152.23, "e": 153.04}]}, {"start": 163.99, "end": 165.53, "text": "Keskustelu on päättynyt.", "words": [{"w": "Keskustelu", "s": 163.94, "e": 164.47}, {"w": "on", "s": 164.47, "e": 165.0}, {"w": "päättynyt.", "s": 165.0, "e": 165.53}]}]}